    "fullContentHtml":  "\n\u003ch1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\"\u003eUPSSSC Forest Guard / Wildlife Guard Medical Admit Card 2026\u003c/h1\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\"\u003e\n\n\u003cp class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\"\u003ePost Date: \u003ctime class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2026-06-09T14:51:20+05:30\"\u003eJune 9, 2026\u003c/time\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cspan class=\"custom-post-time\"\u003e2:51 pm\u003c/span\u003e\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cp class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003ca href=\"http://upsssc.gov.in/\"\u003eUttar Pradesh Subordinate Services Selection Commission\u003c/a\u003e,\u003c/strong\u003e has released the \u003cstrong\u003eMedical Admit Card \u003c/strong\u003eon its\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eofficial website\u003c/strong\u003e for the Recruitment of \u003cstrong\u003eForest Guard\u0026nbsp;Examination 2025.\u003c/strong\u003e The Medical Exam will be conducted on\u003cstrong\u003e 15 June 2026\u003c/strong\u003e, and\u0026nbsp; the last date to submit the application form was \u003cstrong data-start=\"230\" data-end=\"250\"\u003e10 October 2023\u003c/strong\u003e. Candidates can check their \u003cstrong\u003eMedical Admit Card\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;using\u0026nbsp;their\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong data-start=\"302\" data-end=\"362\"\u003eEnrollment Number, Registration Number, or Date of Birth\u003c/strong\u003e by logging into the \u003cstrong\u003eportal. The direct link\u003c/strong\u003e is provided below. \u003cspan style=\"color: #ff0000;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e(Advt No. : 10/2023)\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\"\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e\n\u003ca href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri\u0026amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    \u003c/a\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n    \n\u003cdiv class=\"social-buttons\"\u003e\u003c!-- WhatsApp Button --\u003e \u003ca class=\"social-button whatsapp\" href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e WhatsApp \u003c/a\u003e \u003c!-- Telegram Button --\u003e \u003ca class=\"social-button telegram\" href=\"https://t.me/SarkariExam_info\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e Telegram \u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-f58e6ca1\"\u003e\n\n\u003ch2 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-2ca5a791 gb-headline-text\"\u003eUPSSSC Forest Guard / Wildlife Guard Medical Admit Card 2026\u003c/h2\u003e\n\n\n\u003ch3 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-7d5f86e8 gb-headline-text\"\u003eUPSSSC Forest Guard Examination 2025 : Short Details\u003c/h3\u003e\n\n\u003cp class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-79adf169 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/upsssc-forest-guard-2026/\"\u003eSarkariResult.com.cm\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-303102a8\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-d96c68be\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-d96c68be\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-16a90584\"\u003e\n\n\u003ch4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-22b2e02b gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eImportant Dates\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\n\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-3b2f0e17 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\"\u003eOnline Apply Start Date\u003cstrong\u003e : 20 September 2023\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\"\u003eOnline Apply Last Date : \u003cstrong\u003e10 October 2023\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\"\u003eFee Payment Last Date : \u003cstrong\u003e10 October 2023\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\"\u003eCorrection Date\u003cstrong\u003e : 17 October 2023\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\"\u003eExam Date : \u003cstrong\u003e09 November 2025\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\"\u003eExam City Details : \u003cstrong\u003e30 October 2025\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\"\u003eAdmit Card :\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003e06 November 2025\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #000000;\"\u003eAnswer Key : \u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e10 November 2025\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #000000;\"\u003eResult Date : \u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e08 January 2026\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003ePET / PMT Date :\u003cstrong\u003e 10 February 2026\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eAdmit Card : \u003cstrong\u003e04 February 2026\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003ePET Result : \u003cstrong\u003e30 April 2026\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: #ffff00; font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMedical Exam Date : 15 June 2026\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eAdmit Card : \u003cspan style=\"color: #ff0000;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e09 June 2026 Available Now\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\"\u003eCandidates are advised to confirm from the \u003cb\u003eUPSSSC\u003c/b\u003e\u0026nbsp;official website.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-fcbb81ff\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-fcbb81ff\"\u003e\n\n\u003ch4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4ddaf9ee gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eApplication Fee\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\n\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-989f3ffd gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\"\u003eFor All Candidates : ₹ 25/-\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePayment Mode (Online):\u003c/strong\u003e You can make the payment using the following methods:\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eDebit Card\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eCredit Card\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eInternet Banking\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eIMPS\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eCash Card / Mobile Wallet\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-6b6fbcac\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-8aa46b64\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-0f18d865\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-0f18d865\"\u003e\n\u003ch5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-0b3ada47 gb-headline-text\"\u003eUPSSSC Forest Guard Notification 2025 : Age Limits As On 01 July 2023\u003c/h5\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-28dede61 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eMinimum Age : \u003cstrong\u003e18 Year\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eMaximum Age : \u003cstrong\u003e40 Year\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUPSSSC\u003c/strong\u003e provides age relaxation for the \u003cstrong\u003eForest Guard\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003eposition as per their regulations.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-860b2712\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-860b2712\"\u003e\n\n\u003ch5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-f2184b83 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTotal Post\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h5\u003e\n\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4259c0c2 gb-headline-text\"\u003e709 Post\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003c!-- SarkariResult --\u003e\n\n\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e\n\u003ca href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri\u0026amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    \u003c/a\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n    \n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003c!-- SarkariResult --\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-ec1f6e4c\"\u003e\n\u003ch6 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c7683bda gb-headline-text\"\u003eUPSSSC Forest Guard Recruitment 2023 : Vacancy Details\u003c/h6\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-60ccea19 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003ctable style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 24.7814%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePost Name\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 15.2034%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNo. Of Post\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 60.0151%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEligibility Criteria\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 24.7814%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eForest Guard\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 15.2034%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e693\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 60.0151%; text-align: center;\" rowspan=\"2\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eCandidates must have\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong data-start=\"62\" data-end=\"97\"\u003epassed the UPSSSC PET 2022 exam\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;and should be\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong data-start=\"112\" data-end=\"149\"\u003e12th pass from a recognized board\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 24.7814%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eWild Life Guard\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 15.2034%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e16\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ctable style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #800000;\"\u003eYou May Also Check :\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e \u003ca href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/upsssc-draftsman-cartographer-exam-date-2025/\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUPSSSC Draftsman \u0026amp; Cartographer Exam Date 2025\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ctable style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;How To Check \u0026amp; Download UPSSSC Forest Guard Medical Admit Card 2026\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1w21z4y\" data-start=\"150\" data-end=\"230\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eVisit the \u003cstrong\u003eofficial website\u003c/strong\u003e of\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr data-start=\"182\" data-end=\"185\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"whitespace-normal\"\u003eUttar Pradesh Subordinate Services Selection Commission\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1ibh2et\" data-start=\"232\" data-end=\"288\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eOn the homepage, click on the \u003cstrong data-start=\"265\" data-end=\"278\"\u003e“Admit Card”\u003c/strong\u003e section\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1j03yig\" data-start=\"290\" data-end=\"354\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eFind and click on\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr data-start=\"310\" data-end=\"313\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"316\" data-end=\"354\"\u003e“Forest Guard Medical Admit Card 2026”\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1ghk9lf\" data-start=\"356\" data-end=\"399\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eThe Exam Date will open in \u003cstrong data-start=\"383\" data-end=\"397\"\u003ePDF format\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1irqa76\" data-start=\"401\" data-end=\"465\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003ePress \u003cstrong data-start=\"410\" data-end=\"422\"\u003eCtrl + F\u003c/strong\u003e and search your:\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"443\" data-end=\"465\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1cb4ou\" data-start=\"443\" data-end=\"465\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eRoll Number / Name\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"hs9rtr\" data-start=\"467\" data-end=\"518\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eIf your details appear → \u003cstrong data-start=\"495\" data-end=\"516\"\u003eYou are qualified\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"dz5t2i\" data-start=\"520\" data-end=\"575\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eDownload and \u003cstrong data-start=\"536\" data-end=\"558\"\u003esave/print the PDF\u003c/strong\u003e for future use\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ctable style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #ffffff;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;UPSSSC Forest Guard Recruitment 2025 : \u003c/span\u003eMode Of Selection\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul class=\"wp-block-list\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWritten Exam\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePET / PST\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDV, Medical Test\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ctable style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #cc0052;\"\u003eJoin Our